tain but less probable to be played immediately), this move minimizes their ability to retaliate while accelerating my progress toward emptying my hand. Playing singles or pairs would be less efficient in card reduction and could allow the landlord to maintain control.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♣3", "♣4", "♣5", "♠6", "♠7"]}'}
